name: Regeneration preserves reviewed proposal history and creates unapproved drafts
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/proposal_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup
submit: strategy keep review-cargo-audit-scan
submit: strategy skip review-dep-hygiene-check
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/proposal_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART decisions
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/proposal_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART regenerate
submit: strategy
require-live-snap: 25 12 proposed, 1 approved | regenerated-queue
expect: STRATEGY QUEUE
expect: 1 approved
expect: 1 rejected
expect-not: Map 1/3
ask: Does the regenerated queue distinguish new drafts from retained decisions and clearly disclose that earlier approval and outcomes belong to original ids?
submit: strategy inspect review-cargo-audit-scan
require-live-snap: 25 approved $0.5000 | retained-approval
expect: operator-retained-context-preference
expect: STRATEGY PROPOSAL
submit: strategy inspect review-secret-scan-scan
require-live-snap: 25 owned-synthetic-result | retained-outcome
expect: approved $0.6000
expect: actual $0.2000
expect: 1/2 confirmed
nav-mode:
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 owned-synthetic-result | queue-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 owned-synthetic-result | queue-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 owned-synthetic-result | queue-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.5
require-live-snap: 10 STRATEGY PROPOSAL | queue-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.5
live-snap: queue-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: queue-page-40x12
expect: $0.6000
expect: actual $0.2000
expect: outcome: 1/2 confirmed
keys: NPage
live-snap: queue-outcome-40x12
expect: result run: owned-synthetic-result
keys: G
live-snap: queue-tail-40x12
expect-not: kz> G
ask: Can the operator page through complete ids, costs, correction and historical result references across all six sizes without changing input ownership?
resize: 120x36
submit: strategy inspect review-semgrep-scan
require-live-snap: 25 OWNED_SYNTHETIC_FAILURE_EVIDENCE | retained-failure
expect: owned-synthetic-failure-run
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup-still-needed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/proposal_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART after
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | restarted
submit: strategy
require-live-snap: 25 1 approved | restarted-queue
expect: 1 rejected
expect: Regenerated suggestions are new drafts
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/proposal_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain real operator decisions and labeled historical receipts, while new drafts remain unapproved and no tool execution occurs?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-restart-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
